flowchart TB
    Validated[Validated source version] --> Inspect[Inspect pages, format and metadata]
    Inspect --> Route{Select extraction route}

    subgraph extractionRoutes [Measured extraction routes]
        direction LR
        Native[Native text and structure extraction]
        OCR[Selective OCR and layout recovery]
        Specialist[Approved specialist extraction]
    end

    Route -->|Reliable native text| Native
    Route -->|Scanned or mixed pages| OCR
    Route -->|Complex table or visual| Specialist

    Native --> Normalise[Normalise and attach provenance]
    OCR --> Normalise
    Specialist --> Normalise
    Normalise --> Enrich[Attach owner, classification, lifecycle and policy reference]
    Enrich --> Checks[Run coverage, order, hierarchy, table and anomaly checks]
    Checks --> Decide{Quality decision}

    subgraph qualityOutcomes [Quality outcomes]
        direction LR
        Canonical[(Immutable canonical revision)]
        Review[Owner compares source region and output]
        Reject[Reject with actionable reason]
    end

    Decide -->|Accepted| Canonical
    Decide -->|Material uncertainty| Review
    Decide -->|Unsupported, unsafe or unreadable| Reject
    Review -->|Correct extraction| Normalise
    Review -->|Use another route| Route

    subgraph derivedPublication [Derived output and controlled publication]
        direction LR
        Chunk[Create structure-aware chunks]
        Index[Build derived lexical and vector indexes]
        Validate[Validate completeness and retrieval profile]
        Publish[Atomically mark complete revision eligible]
    end

    Canonical --> Chunk
    Chunk --> Index
    Index --> Validate
    Validate --> Publish
